the same roadblocks that quietly slow delivery, limit capacity, and hurt margins."},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"40c4698c-b477-04d1-0fc5-2b797de72261","text":{"html":"<div class="subheading-large margin-bottom-5"><strong data-w-id="1ed89d1d-538d-9c0e-d34f-730759ca4b09">Bottlenecked Delivery</strong></div>","text":"Bottlenecked Delivery"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"40c4698c-b477-04d1-0fc5-2b797de72263","text":{"html":"<p class="paragraph-small-2 margin-bottom-20px">Your team is stretched thin. Projects move slower, timelines slip, and you’re forced to turn down work you should be able to take on.</p>","text":"Your team is stretched thin. Projects move slower, timelines slip, and you’re forced to turn down work you should be able to take on."},"attributes":{}},{"type":"image","id":"9c974965-5420-e590-e08f-ec236555e231","image":{"alt":"__wf_reserved_inherit","assetId":"69608493f4881e9f934c249b"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"b606dd56-e011-e366-5f43-0c44722b8807","text":{"html":"<div class="subheading-large margin-bottom-5"><strong data-w-id="b606dd56-e011-e366-5f43-0c44722b8808">Unreliable Outsourcing</strong></div>","text":"Unreliable Outsourcing"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"b606dd56-e011-e366-5f43-0c44722b880a","text":{"html":"<p class="paragraph-small-2 margin-bottom-20px">Freelancers and vendors deliver inconsistent quality, miss deadlines, or require constant follow-ups — putting your brand reputation and client trust at risk.</p>","text":"Freelancers and vendors deliver inconsistent quality, miss deadlines, or require constant follow-ups — putting your brand reputation and client trust at risk."},"attributes":{}},{"type":"image","id":"b606dd56-e011-e366-5f43-0c44722b880c","image":{"alt":"__wf_reserved_inherit","assetId":"696083a8211349d989663ac4"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"f282e27e-91f6-f178-277a-d28c690e794f","text":{"html":"<div class="subheading-large margin-bottom-5"><strong data-w-id="f282e27e-91f6-f178-277a-d28c690e7950">High Hiring Costs</strong></div>","text":"High Hiring Costs"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"text","id":"f282e27e-91f6-f178-277a-d28c690e7952","text":{"html":"<p class="paragraph-small-2 margin-bottom-20px">Scaling through full-time hires means salaries, onboarding, tools, and long ramp-up times — all before you see real ROI.</p>","text":"Scaling through full-time hires means salaries, onboarding, tools, and long ramp-up times — all before you see real ROI."},"attributes":{}},{"type":"image","id":"f282e27e-91f6-f178-277a-d28c690e7954","image":{"alt":"__wf_reserved_inherit","assetId":"69608410617be70bed7a8cda"},"attributes":{}},{"type":"html-embed","id":"d453adc2-b40a-2a80-8bce-fceafcd7134d","html":"<h3 class="image-in-text">Boldteq removes these blockers by acting as your dedicated white-label backend team 
